# =============================================================================
# Axal StudioOS — Git LFS tracking
# =============================================================================
# Strategy (see MIGRATION_LFS_AUDIT.md):
#   - LFS: versioned source artifacts that belong with the codebase
#     (design sources, ML weights, fixture archives, deck-template PSDs).
#   - R2:  runtime-served traffic (uploads, signed contracts, deck exports,
#          backups, KYC docs). NOT in this file.
#   - GH Releases: public point-in-time artifacts (sector reports, public DD
#                  summaries, quarterly Investor Signals PDFs).
#   - Worker bundle: tiny atomic assets (favicons, OG fallback, regexes).
#
# History is NOT rewritten — these rules apply to NEW and RE-ADDED files only.
# Existing in-tree blobs stay where they are until they are rotated.

# ---- Design sources ----------------------------------------------------------
*.psd     filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.psb     filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.ai      filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.xd      filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.fig     filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.sketch  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# ---- ML weights / model artifacts -------------------------------------------
