# ---- Fonts ------------------------------------------------------------------
*.woff2  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# ---- The build stamp -------------------------------------------------------
# `docs/.build-source` is one line: a SHA-256 of `frontend/src` that the build
# writes last (D103). Because it is a tracked file whose single line changes
# whenever the source does, ANY two branches that touch `frontend/src` conflict
# on it — always, by construction. That happened five times in one day.
#
# `union` is a BUILT-IN driver, which is the whole reason it is the one used: a
# custom driver needs repo-local `git config merge.<name>.driver`, and this repo
# has no postinstall, no prepare and no hooks path to install one — and the
# check that actually goes red runs against GitHub's own server-side merge,
# where no local config exists at all.
#
# The merged result is two hashes and is meaningless. That is fine and is the
# point: the correct value is a pure function of the merged source, so it can
# only ever come from re-running `npm run build`. What this buys is that the
# rebuild is prompted by a CI message instead of a conflict marker.
# `scripts/check-docs-fresh.mjs` refuses a two-line stamp under `--strict`
# rather than falling through to the timestamp proxy, so the union merge cannot
# pass unnoticed. See D113.
docs/.build-source merge=union

# ---- Line endings ----------------------------------------------------------
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf

# The OG card generator inlines this font's BYTES into each card's HTML and
# fingerprints the result (scripts/generate-og-images.mjs). Under the *.woff2
# rule above it becomes a 130-byte LFS pointer for anyone without git-lfs —
# including actions/checkout, which does not fetch LFS by default — so every
# card fingerprints against the pointer and the "Card images are current" gate
# fails on all 13. It has always been a full blob in git for that reason; the
# exception is pinned here so a repo-wide re-tracking sweep cannot silently
# undo it again. (.agents/memory/font-lfs-attribute-quirk.md has the history.)
scripts/og-assets/SpaceGrotesk-Variable.woff2 -filter -diff -merge -text
